<% content_for :title, "How it works · SUMZ" %>

<main class="page page--narrow">
  <%= link_to "← Home", root_path, class: "back-link" %>
  <h1 class="heading">How it works</h1>

  <section class="how-to" aria-labelledby="game-heading">
    <h2 class="settings__heading" id="game-heading">Two minutes of sums</h2>
    <ul class="how-to__list">
      <li><strong>Streaks score.</strong> 10 for a right answer, 20 for the next in a row, then 30, 40… A wrong answer starts you again at 10.</li>
      <li><strong>Times tables, division, adding and subtracting</strong>, all mixed in.</li>
      <li><strong>The questions keep up with you.</strong> Answer quickly and they get harder: bigger tables and bigger numbers to add and take away, then zeroes, then decimals. Slow down or slip up and they ease off.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="how-to" aria-labelledby="power-heading">
    <h2 class="settings__heading" id="power-heading">Power-ups</h2>
    <ul class="how-to__list">
      <li>A spinner appears at the top after 3 answers, then after 5 more, 8 more, 13 more and so on, further apart each time. Tap it to stop it and claim what it lands on: a <strong>Bonus</strong> (+10 or +20 on each of your next 5 right answers), a <strong>Boost</strong> (+30 on each), a <strong>Streak shield</strong>, <strong>Extra time</strong>, <strong>Coins</strong> (+100), a <strong>Superstar</strong> (your next 5 answers all count as right) or a <strong>Skip</strong> (pass on a question without breaking your streak).</li>
      <li>In a battle you get your own spinners the same way, plus an extra one if you fall far behind. Most hit everyone else: a <strong>Freeze</strong>, <strong>Scrambled</strong> keys, an <strong>Ink blot</strong>, <strong>Mini text</strong>, a <strong>Mirror</strong> or a <strong>Streak breaker</strong>. A <strong>Curveball</strong> gives everyone else 3 tough questions. A <strong>Homing shot</strong> hits only the leader, and a <strong>Shot</strong> freezes only the player next to you. Some help you instead: <strong>Coins</strong>, a <strong>Superstar</strong> (nothing can hit you, and your next answers all count) a <strong>Shield</strong>, which blocks the next attack on you, a <strong>Rocket</strong> (5 easy questions to catch up), a <strong>Skip</strong>, or a <strong>Decoy</strong>, which turns everyone else's next power-up into a fake.</li>
      <li>Fall far behind and you might get the <strong>Bomb</strong>: everyone else's score back to zero!</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="how-to" aria-labelledby="battle-heading">
    <h2 class="settings__heading" id="battle-heading">Battles and leagues</h2>
    <ul class="how-to__list">
      <li><strong>Find a match</strong> to battle anyone online, or <strong>host a battle</strong> and share its code with friends.</li>
      <li>Your best solo game each day goes in the <strong>world league</strong> and your own leagues, for families and classes. They start again at midnight (UK time).</li>
      <li><strong>Awards</strong> for your first game, first win, longest streaks, highest scores and more.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <%= link_to "Play now", play_path, class: "button button--start button--wide" %>
</main>
